flowchart TD
 A([First App Launch]) --> B[OB-01 Welcome Screen]
 B --> C{User action}
 C -- Tap Get Started --> D[OB-02 Hardware Pairing]
 C -- Tap Learn More --> HELP[External help page\nor in-app Quick Start]
 HELP --> D

 D --> E{Pairing Method}
 E -- Scan QR Code --> F[ Activate camera\nQR scanner overlay]
 E -- Enter Serial Number --> G[Manual serial input field\nKeyboard appears]

 F --> H{QR Scan Result}
 H -- QR scanned successfully --> I[ Pairing request sent\nto Guardian hardware]
 H -- Camera permission denied --> CAM[ Camera permission error\nInstructions to enable in browser settings]
 H -- QR unrecognized --> QR_ERR[ Invalid QR\nTry again or switch to serial]
 CAM --> F
 QR_ERR --> E

 G --> I2[ Pairing request sent\nvia serial number]

 I --> J[OB-03 Connecting...\nLoading state]
 I2 --> J

 J --> K{Connection Result}
 K -- Connected --> L[OB-04 Pairing Success\nDevice name + ID shown]
 K -- Guardian not found --> M[OB-05 Pairing Failed\nError message + options]
 K -- Timeout after 30s --> M

 M --> N{User choice}
 N -- Try Again --> D
 N -- Get Help --> HELP2[Quick Start guide\nor contact support]
 N -- Skip for now\nno hardware --> SKIP_HW[ Limited mode\nApp works with cached data only]
 SKIP_HW --> ACCT

 L --> O[Tap Continue]
 O --> ACCT[OB-06 Account Setup]

 ACCT --> P{Auth type}
 P -- Create new account --> Q[Email + password\ninput form]
 P -- Log in existing --> LOGIN[Email + password\nlogin form]

 Q --> R[ Account created\nDID auto-generated by system]
 LOGIN --> R2[ Session restored\nExisting DID loaded]

 R --> DID[OB-07 DID Introduction\nExplainer + DID string + Copy button]
 R2 --> DID

 DID --> S{User action}
 S -- Copy DID + Continue --> CIRCLE
 S -- Skip DID --> CIRCLE
 S -- Tap What is a DID? --> DID_HELP[Expandable explainer\nplain language description]
 DID_HELP --> S

 CIRCLE[OB-08 Create First Circle\nOptional step]
 CIRCLE --> T{User choice}
 T -- Fill in name + Create --> U[ Certificate Authority\ngenerated\nCircle network initialized]
 T -- Skip for now --> DONE
 T -- What is a Circle? --> C_HELP[Expandable explainer]
 C_HELP --> T

 U --> V{Circle creation result}
 V -- Success --> DONE
 V -- Failed --> C_ERR[Error message\nRetry or skip]
 C_ERR --> T

 DONE[OB-09 All Set! Summary screen]
 DONE --> W[Tap Go to Dashboard]
 W --> X([HM-01 Home Dashboard\nOnboarding complete ])
